Scope

Log group: /dna/instance-logs
Streams scoped per instance via standalone/<instance-id>/ prefix (required given the group holds ~10k streams)
Window: last 7 days of events per instance
Included command-history content (history.log) wherever it is multiplexed into the per-instance streams

Credential patterns searched

Category	What was matched
Generic secrets	password/passwd/pwd/passphrase/secret with an assigned value
Mail (postfix/dovecot)	sasl_username/sasl_password, SMTP AUTH PLAIN/AUTH LOGIN base64 blobs, dovecot auth lines
Proxy (squid)	Proxy-Authorization, proxy_auth, ncsa_auth lines
HTTP basic auth	Authorization: Basic <base64>
URLs with embedded creds	scheme://user:pass@host
Password hashes	$apr1$, $1$/$5$/$6$, {SSHA}/{SHA}
SNMP	community/rocommunity/rwcommunity strings
DNS (dnsmasq/BIND)	TSIG keys, secret "..."
Private keys	-----BEGIN ... PRIVATE KEY----- blocks
CLI-flag creds (from history)	-p<val>/--password, curl -u, redis-cli -a, PGPASSWORD=/MYSQL_PWD=, htpasswd -b, doveadm pw -p, openssl ... pass:

Limitations noted

Interactive password prompts don’t appear in history (read from TTY, not command line)
Lines prefixed with a space may be absent if HISTCONTROL=ignorespace was set
Base64 AUTH blobs are flagged but need decoding to confirm
